{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（29日）早上9時13分，沙田鄉事會路有專線小巴與客貨車相撞，初步有7人受傷，包括小巴司機及乘客，多部救護車正在場協助。</p><figure><img alt=\"傷者由救護員扶上車。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260929/1181542220814356480384572.jpeg/o_Lmoo2hxz0yatR103IbZke1WGrMcg7_BTWL_wU1i_8\"/><figcaption>傷者由救護員扶上車。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涉事小巴來往沙田火車站與桂地街。（黃煦緻攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260929/1181544710955601920140269.jpeg/xQFoqZoQHI1eG5jusXLQVCj9aRhAXjZtxrqMssa6jLI\"/><figcaption>涉事小巴來往沙田火車站與桂地街。（黃煦緻攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"客貨車司機在場助查。（黃煦緻攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260929/1181546999279783936389567.jpeg/bf0VMqBWgtPyIIeOIxZyCLaw4f1NQ9BPlqZ3YZamd2E\"/><figcaption>客貨車司機在場助查。（黃煦緻攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"客貨車車窗盡碎。（黃煦緻攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260929/1181545909159202816735609.jpeg/oODlFNmi7JWbTpKYzhx2dgvq0cKgoYSE24U0S9uFNEs\"/><figcaption>客貨車車窗盡碎。（黃煦緻攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涉事客貨車右邊車身凹陷。（黃煦緻攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260929/1181544713736556544467320.jpeg/wSVXtdcbSSK8RWniFJSPy3KACfr6j9xHh0FmjIdBZow\"/><figcaption>涉事客貨車右邊車身凹陷。（黃煦緻攝）</figcaption></figure><p>涉事專事小巴60P，來往港鐵沙田站與桂地街。據報小巴司機與3男3女乘客受傷，其中5人送院，其餘人敷治後自行離開；警方正調查意外原因。</p><figure><img alt=\"小巴與客貨車相撞，多人受傷。（黃煦緻攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260929/1181545256605192192470538.jpeg/m49AZWtlY_2JanmdntnWAjT4fYKfma927xwpVO8cKVQ\"/><figcaption>小巴與客貨車相撞，多人受傷。（黃煦緻攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"多部救護車在場協助處理傷者。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260929/1181542216204554240731948.jpeg/o17f4z3I8xu8RaMzAPvnIN4AYocb9nygJ9k9tyfZPbc\"/><figcaption>多部救護車在場協助處理傷者。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-29T02:20:13.372935+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":250,"images":7,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}